 "permalink": "https://stackoverflow.com/questions/21767320/replacing-malloc-free-with-new-delete-in-c",
 "body_html": "<p>I just want to be sure.</p>\n\n<p>this is my code</p>\n\n<pre><code>int * Image = (int *)malloc(sizeof(int) * m_Width/2 * m_Height);\nfree(Image);\n</code></pre>\n\n<p>if I want to use new Instead of malloc and free instead of delete.\nthis is what i wrote </p>\n\n<pre><code>int* Image = new int[m_Width/2 * m_Height];\ndelete[] Image;\n</code></pre>\n\n<p>Is that correct?</p>\n",
