   "license": "CC BY-SA 3.0",
   "body_html": "int* image = malloc(sizeof(int)* m_Width/2 * m_Height); ?? @jia103"
  },
  {
   "post_type": "comment",
   "post_id": 32929482,
   "parent_id": 21767320,
   "parent_type": "question",
   "author_user_id": 65863,
   "author_display_name": "Remy Lebeau",
   "author_id_missing": false,
   "role": "responder",
   "is_accepted": null,
   "permalink": "https://stackoverflow.com/questions/21767320/#comment32929482_21767320",
   "score": 0,
   "created_utc": "2014-02-13T23:09:25Z",
   "edited": false,
   "license": "CC BY-SA 3.0",
   "body_html": "<code>malloc()</code> returns a <code>void*</code>.  In C++, you have to type-cast it."
  },
  {
